# Typography in context

Typography in context is now split across the [Typography](typography.html) pages:

- [Typeface](typography-typeface.html#bg-typ-01): using Arial everywhere Civica sets the text
- [Paragraphs](typography-paragraphs.html#bg-typ-02): laying out text for reading
- [Web-app typography](typography-web-app.html): readings and units, native screens, and checks at larger text sizes
- [Print typography](typography-print.html#bg-typ-06): text sizes for print
- [Social typography](typography-social.html): text in social images
